  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The entropy of a system is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"S\"></span>, and the number of possible microstates is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Ω\"></span>. What is the number of possible microstates for a system of entropy <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{S}{2}\"></span>?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{Ω}{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\sqrt{Ω}}{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{Ω}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Ω^{2}\"></span></li></ol>"
